  "items": [
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أهلًا بك في مهامي باختياري. اختر مهمة تحبها، وجهز أدواتها، ثم رتب خطواتها. نفذها في الواقع، واطلب المساعدة أو استرح متى احتجت.",
      "path": "audio/silma/d8fa21c7e2508f5b.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أجهز حقيبتي",
      "path": "audio/silma/0f5c8b36bba706c0.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أجهز حقيبة لجلسة قراءة ورسم.",
      "path": "audio/silma/0657862b771be3be.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أختار كتابًا أريد قراءته.",
      "path": "audio/silma/413f24dd2f8b97a9.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أضع ورقة وأقلامًا كبيرة في الحقيبة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/9cc40b272064bd53.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أضع الكتاب برفق في الحقيبة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/de80c80e818a316d.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أراجع ما أحتاجه، ثم أغلق الحقيبة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/a8284dc117f5485c.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أضع حقيبتي في مكان أعرفه.",
      "path": "audio/silma/ae8bf3cfdccd9a4f.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "انظر إلى الأشياء التي اخترتها. هل هي موجودة في حقيبتك؟",
      "path": "audio/silma/0dcec40b9dbb88d6.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "في المرة القادمة سأختار الأدوات قبل فتح الحقيبة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/e0e604c86b6b8293.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "ركن اللعب",
      "path": "audio/silma/a1cb8130f320db10.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أعيد الألعاب إلى أماكن يسهل العثور عليها.",
      "path": "audio/silma/b98ef2eff992d8c3.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أختار مكانًا للمكعبات ومكانًا للكرة.",
      "path": "audio/silma/21a4ebf674b2be56.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أجمع المكعبات الكبيرة في صندوقها.",
      "path": "audio/silma/20c170d9f09880b4.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أضع الكرة في مكانها.",
      "path": "audio/silma/f08064b9b777b644.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أنظر إلى الأرض وأترك ممرًا خاليًا.",
      "path": "audio/silma/7db3aeca5a2ef5a7.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "أختار صورة تذكرني بمكان الألعاب.",
      "path": "audio/silma/1eb94e55f9e2d927.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "يمكنك جمع نوع واحد أولًا، وطلب المساعدة في الباقي.",
      "path": "audio/silma/0f13786216281a98.mp3",
      "status": "not-generated",
      "review_status": "tashkeel-and-listening-review-required"
    },
    {
      "language": "ar",
      "engine": "silma",
      "text": "في المرة القادمة سأرتب نوعًا واحدًا في كل مرة.",
